WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
A useful diagnosis points to evidence.

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:07.440
Supply the assistant with relevant logs,
trace identifiers and change context.

00:00:07.653 --> 00:00:12.080
It proposes a cause with inspectable
lines, and an engineer confirms

00:00:12.187 --> 00:00:16.160
or corrects it. The industrial
example separates the manually

00:00:16.204 --> 00:00:20.240
reviewed accuracy sample from the much
larger deployment population.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:25.600
Do the same locally: evaluate sampled
diagnoses, citation correctness

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.040
and total investigation effort without
claiming accuracy on unreviewed cases.
